cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool or the derivation behind it, please cite it as below."
title: "Carbonation Bench Log: phase-diagram relations and a bench tool for carbonation experiments on lime-treated soil"
abstract: >-
  A browser tool and the phase-diagram derivation it implements, for preparing and reducing carbonation experiments on lime-treated soil. The degree of carbonation is referred to the reactive lime and excludes carbonate present before the test, which corrects two systematic errors common in spreadsheet reductions.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-18"

